-elena-tentis-118658-726001_1.43_1.png","th":"","ts":1790715600000,"h":["A taverna is not just a menu","Start with what is actually available","Meze, mains and how to order without overdoing it","When you eat matters","Bread, water and the small details","How to spot a place built for repeat customers","What visitors often misunderstand"]},{"id":3205018,"p":"/why-athens-looks-the-way-it-does","t":"Why Athens Looks the Way It Does: Ancient Ruins, Apartment Blocks and the Modern City","d":"Why does Athens look so different from other European capitals? A guide to the ancient layers, apartment blocks and urban changes that shaped the modern city.","c":[5],"i":"https://d1yei2z3i6k35z.cloudfront.net/18368091/6abff8691a9b21.58564283_athens-urban-fabric-hero_1.43_1.png","th":"https://d1yei2z3i6k35z.cloudfront.net/thumb_150/6abff8691a9b21.58564283_athens-urban-fabric-hero_1.43_1.png","ts":1790715600000,"h":["Athens is a city of layers","Why so much of Athens looks twentieth-century","The rise of the polykatoikia","Why old houses survive unevenly","How to read Athens while you walk","What this changes for a first-time visitor"]}],"terms":{"1960":[5,16,1,16],"19th":[5,16,1,64],"above":[2,16,1,4],"abroad":[4,16,1,128],"absorbed":[2,16,1,16],"acceptance":[1,16,1,32],"accepted":[1,16,1,256],"accommodation":[1,16,1,2],"according":[3,16,1,8],"acropolis":[1,18,2,264,3,16,1,2],"across":[1,16,2,36,5,16,1,32],"act":[3,16,1,4],"active":[0,16,2,32,3,16,1,16,5,16,1,32],"activity":[0,16,1,64,3,16,1,32],"actually":[1,2,0,4,4,2,0,4],"adapt":[0,2,0,128],"add":[2,16,1,32,3,16,1,4,4,16,2,8,5,16,1,8],"adjustment":[0,16,1,128],"advance":[1,2,0,128],"affect":[0,16,1,8,1,16,1,128],"afternoon":[0,16,2,132,1,16,1,8,2,16,1,128,3,16,1,32,4,16,1,16],"again":[0,16,2,68,2,16,1,8,3,16,2,40],"aggressively":[1,16,1,64],"agora":[2,18,2,24],"ahead":[2,16,1,4],"airport":[1,18,4,262],"allow":[2,16,1,128,3,16,1,2],"almost":[1,16,1,64,2,16,1,2,3,16,2,5,4,16,1,64,5,16,2,24],"alone":[1,16,2,66,4,16,1,64],"along":[2